         <h3>Grab Great Deals: Evolvement and Expansion since its inception!</h3>
         <p class="text-justify">Grab Great Deals has established itself as a large company with Technologies which enables more than 50000 shipments per month, more than 80000 daily page views, 5000 warehouse across the country with thousands of sellers and millions of registered users and more. Its vast expansion and growth is evident from the fact that it offers great deals of affordable ranges on various products making it a ‘junction’ for customers who loves purchasing products from Grab Great Deals from the comfort of their houses. </p>
         <p class="text-justify">Coming to its authenticated services, Grab Great Deals provides 24*7 customer support, dedicated logistics for faster deliveries. It also provides 7-14 days replacement policies. Grab Great Deals also provides launched fashion and lifestyle portfolios, on time deliveries guaranteed and million dollar funding. It also keeps in check the scheduled deliveries. </p>
         <h3>GROWTH IN DELIVERY NETWORK STATIONS AND SERVICES</h3>
         <p class="text-justify">Grab Great Deals significantly augmented in its delivery network ahead of the much-awaited festive season. The company has notably ramped up its delivery infrastructure, and added tens of thousands of delivery partners to the network to serve and meet the rising customer demand for all the festive season. Close to approximately 100 delivery stations have been added, including those operated by the Delivery Service Partners across the country to further its direct reach, including in many remote towns such as Cape York, Far North Queensland, McLaren Vale, Dubbo, Bathurst and many other. </p>
         <p class="text-justify">Also alongside this, the company has strengthened its delivery program, partners with local store owners and Manufacturer to deliver products to customers within a 3 to 5 kilometres radius of their store, allowing them to supplement their regular income and generate more reach and footfalls in their stores. This initiative of strengthening its bond with the local store owners and other manufacturers is something that would help its expansion even double the times in the future.</p>
         <p class="text-justify">That’s what Grab Great Deals made highly visible with its deep connection to the above partners. The Company has nearly doubled the reach of the deliveries in the last four months, to now serve all the states, internal and external territories of Australia. With its immense victory of crossing a benchmark on developing its delivery network, Grab Great Deals Australia has also marked an increased focus on contactless deliveries.</p>
